# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in your own credentials.
#
# At https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials:
#   1. Create/select a Google Cloud project.
#   2. Enable the "Google Drive API" and the "Google Picker API".
#   3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID of type "Web application". Add
#      http://localhost:5173 (and your deployed static site's origin) to
#      "Authorized JavaScript origins". No redirect URI is needed — Carnation
#      uses the Google Identity Services token client, not a redirect flow.
#   4. Create an API key (used only by the Google Picker folder-chooser UI).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
